      "value": "To write down the elements of ${S}_{4},$ we substitute $n=4$ into the expression and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{4} & =\\{1,2,…,4+1\\} \\\\  & =\\{1,2,…,5\\} \\\\  & =\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
